        <p><b>Group 1 (alkali metals):</b> soft, low m.p.; react with water → hydroxide + H₂; reactivity <b>increases</b> down the group (outer e⁻ lost more easily).</p>
        <p><b>Group 7 (halogens):</b> diatomic; Cl₂ yellow-green gas, Br₂ orange-brown liquid, I₂ grey-black solid; react with metals → metal halides and with H₂ → hydrogen halides (acidic).</p>
